{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>He caused to move</b> — It returns to the account of the meat that it began to tell concerning it; therefore, [compare] 'and HaShem heard and was wrathful.'" "<b>east wind</b> — The meaning is רוח קדים, and it is an adjective, for רוח is found as masculine from 'mountains' [Psalm 104:32]." "<b>south</b> — From the root ימין, and it is the southeast wind."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 78, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:03.239814334Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}